5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want to make sure the new system actually works on the floor. I'll look into the Depot calendar and the peak-season cutover, and the Yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree that operational stability is key. To understand the long-term financial impact, I will look into the Board minutes on capital and operating requests and the Five years of renewal invoices.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know why our projects fail to stay aligned with the business and who takes responsibility when things break. I'll check Support ownership during last winter's outage and Warehouse rule changes after new accounts.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see if we're just patching old things! I'll look into the Upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the Data lift in the 2018 pay move.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to consider the human element. I shall look into Administrator retirements and hiring times, as well as Depot supervisors and the last rollout, to see how our people fare.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
