13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I think we've all picked some really important things! I'm excited to see what we find out. I wonder if the old systems are just hiding their problems?,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Curiosity is a wonderful engine for discovery, Rin. By looking into these different corners, we ensure that our choice is not merely a technical one, but a sustainable one for everyone involved.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
