17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Servas. A sustainable choice requires a comprehensive view of our failures. I look forward to seeing if the data confirms my suspicions about our lack of accountability.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I hope we find something that helps us stop making the same mistakes! I'll be waiting to see if those old data moves were as messy as I think.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,Indeed. The patterns of the past are often the most honest teachers we have. Let us see what truths these records reveal so we may guide our company toward a more stable future.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready to see the results! I hope we find a way to make sure the people in the yards aren't left struggling with tools that don't fit their actual workday.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I am as well. Once we have the facts on the costs and the board's habits, we can ensure we don't choose a path that looks cheap now but becomes a burden later.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I am ready. Once we see the results, we can determine which vendor's structure best prevents the gaps in ownership and the misalignment of scope that have plagued us previously.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! I can't wait to see if the dispatch tool is just a dinosaur in disguise. Let's find out the truth together!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,The stage is set. We have cast our nets into the archives of our history; now we must wait to see what the tide brings back to us. I am ready to reflect on these findings.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
